{\*\bkmkend _Toc384011248}\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 The search for a metaphor for group communication activities resulted in choosing the term "board", having in mind a simple wooden hand-held blackboard. The board metaphor is already common in the world of electronic conferencing services: Bulletin Board Systems are the predecessors of Internet and Online Services. A document, edited by one or more persons, may also be called board. You may stick annotations on a board or mark certain parts. A box for personal messages may be called "personal board". For example, a project team may use a board as a common workspace or as a to-do-list with dates and responsibilities. One may also think of a \lquote peer group board\rquote  that contains references and recommendations. However, where the context requires it, the term board is replaced by more specific terms, i.e. by the name of the specific board type. These types will be described below. Functions marked with (\u164\'db) will be available in the Web4Groups advanced system.\par \par }\pard\plain \s4\qj\sb240\sa60\keepn\nowidctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\outlinelevel3\adjustright \b\i\lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc373042618}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373053796}The Web4Groups board types{\*\bkmkend _Toc373042618}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373053796}\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 Web4Groups offers several board types designed to cover a broad range of applic}{\lang2057 a}{\lang2057 tions. Using Web4Groups, one may create a board with the \lquote New\rquote , \lquote Write\rquote  or \lquote Reply\rquote  button, which can be found on many pages. The annotation facility (\u164\'db) allows to create a board (e.g. a forum) from any web page when browsing.\par \par Boards may represent either }{\i\lang2057 contributions}{\lang2057 , i.e. content information (e.g. a message), or }{\i\lang2057 activ}{\i\lang2057 i}{\i\lang2057 ties}{\lang2057  (e.g. a Forum). Forums, workspaces and folders as well as other activities can hold further boards, behaving like containers with a description text. Messages, files or URLs are content board types, i.e. contributions. A message may also contain other messages (replies). Some additional special board types are available, like the private area with an in- and out-box, a list of subscribed boards and a personal address book. Furthermore any Web4Groups server holds a list of activities on the welcome page (\lquote Homeboard\rquote ). All those boards are called }{\i\lang2057 special folders}{\lang2057 .\par \par }\pard \qj\widctlpar\box\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp20 \pvpara\phpg\posx1489\posy9\absh11225\absw9955\dxfrtext141\dfrmtxtx141\dfrmtxty0{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright {\lang2057 {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft8168\shptop77\shpright9589\shpbottom504\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz52\shplid1078{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn lTxid}{\sv 65536}}{\sp{\sn dxTextLeft}{\sv 12700}}{\sp{\sn dyTextTop}{\sv 12700}}{\sp{\sn dxTextRight}{\sv 12700}}{\sp{\sn dyTextBottom}{\sv 12700}}{\sp{\sn fillColor}{\sv 10066329}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 3175}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fShadow}{\sv 0}}{\shptxt \pard\plain \qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\fs20       SUBTYPES\par }}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxcolumn\dobypara\dodhgt8244\dptxbx\dptxlrtb{\dptxbxtext\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\fs20       SUBTYPES\par }}\dpx8168\dpy77\dpxsize1421\dpysize427\dpfillfgcr255\dpfillfgcg255\dpfillfgcb255\dpfillbgcr153\dpfillbgcg153\dpfillbgcb153\dpfillpat1\dplinehollow}}}{\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft5754\shptop78\shpright7317\shpbottom363\shpfhdr0\