 This can be realised by simply exchanging short special MIME\_type messages as parts of the rated activity, which are just replaced. This requires a function in the database which  is able to replace or supersede message parts.\par \sect }\sectd \pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\margtsxn1440\linex0\endnhere\sectdefaultcl {\header \pard\plain \s28\qj\widctlpar\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp20 \tqr\tx9072\tqr\tx14034\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\f1\fs20 Appendix 1\tab }{\field{\*\fldinst {\cs38\f1\fs20  PAGE }}{\fldrslt {\cs38\f1\fs20\lang1024 67}}}{\f1\fs20 \par }}\pard\plain \s1\qj\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\outlinelevel0\adjustright \b\f1\fs28\lang1031\kerning28\cgrid {\lang2057 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc382828897}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc382896615}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373505069}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373505134}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373505165}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373505333}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373565151}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373651959}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc373660852}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc381770870}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc382828891}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc382896609}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc384011264}Appendix 1: A Scenario of Linking Rating and Co-operation{\*\bkmkend _Toc373505069}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373505134}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373505165}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373505333}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373565151}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373651959}{\*\bkmkend _Toc373660852}{\*\bkmkend _Toc381770870}{\*\bkmkend _Toc382828891}{\*\bkmkend _Toc382896609}{\*\bkmkend _Toc384011264}\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 \par Abstract: This section suggests a new social function of rating in the Internet. The basic idea consists in combining the evaluation of contributions with the organisational structure of co-operative groups. This is done by inventing a \lquote game\lquote  with \lquote players\rquote  and \lquote rules\rquote  which fulfils the special needs of a knowledge-producing community.\par \par }\pard\plain \s2\qj\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\outlinelevel1\adjustright \b\i\f1\lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc373505070}{\*\b