 the discussion. One effective measure against small rotation gangs could be an addition to rule 5:\par \par }\pard\plain \s23\qj\fi-1100\li1120\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 Rule 5.1:\tab To become a directing fellow one needs at least three fruits of one kind from at least two different directing fellows.\par \par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 To bypass this rule one needs even more co-operation, which may be a wanted side-effect.\par \par }{\i\lang2057 How new discussions emerge and evolve}{\lang2057 \par \par New discussions may emerge for two major reasons:\par \par }\pard\plain \s22\qj\fi-500\li500\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 1.\tab Fellows and directing fellows try to keep newbies out. Therefore they set up an additional discussion which may compete with the original one. But this needs an additional rule like\par }\pard\plain \s23\qj\fi-1100\li1120\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 \par Rule 10:\tab It needs at least three persons to start a new discussion. Everyone, including newbies, may do so.\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 \par }\pard\plain \s22\qj\fi-500\li500\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 2.\tab Another reason could be that there is a real need for new discussions, as new topics have arisen.\par \par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 New discussions do not have directing fellows. They are more or less anarchic and they have to pass a phase of self-definition and self-construction until they become regular discussions. Examples are discussions D, E and F in figure 3. The change from provisional to regular discussions must be defined as rules.\par \par }\pard\plain \s23\qj\fi-1100\li1120\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 Rule 11:\tab After a turnover of at least 30 flowers within a month a discussion becomes regular. The two participants holding the largest number of flowers become directing fellows.\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 \par There might be another rule influencing the number of directing fellows. If there is a lot of activity in a discussion, a larger number of directing fellows may be needed:\par \par }\pard\plain \s23\qj\fi-1100\li1120\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1024\cgrid {\lang2057 Rule 12:\tab If the number of contributions in a month exceeds 200, an additional directing fellow is nominated. It is the fellow with the largest number of flowers.\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\adjustright \lang1031\cgrid {\lang2057 \par There are no restrictions for inventing new rules changing the system\rquote s behaviour. All participants may discuss intensively the impact of new rules. Procedures for the introduction of new rules may be introduced as well. \par \par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab }{\fs20\lang2057 {\pict\wmetafile8\picw1446\pich811\picwgoal820\pichgoal460 010009000003b90000000000820000000000050000000b028600a300050000000c02170029000400000004010d00040000002e011800040000000201010005000000090200000000050000000102ffffff00030000001e00040000000701010082000000430f2000cc0000001700290000000300170029008600a300280000003000000017000000010001000000000000000000120b0000120b0000000000000000000000000000ffffff00ffffe3ff8fcf0000fff9f3ff8f0f0000fff071ffce4f0000fff831ffc89f0000fffe4dff873f0000ffff33fe0e7f0000ffffb8fd1eff0000ffffdc603cff0000ffffdf1ffcff0000ffffbffffeff0000ff007ffc7eff0000f01ffff83f7f0000e5e7eff81f7f0000edffc7e01f7f0000f3ffc7c00f7f0000fcffc7c00eff0000ff77c7800eff0000ffbfbf00097f0000ffdf430007bf0000ffdbbc003e7f0000ffb5bfffffff0000ffaebfffffff0000ff9f3fffffff0000040000002701ffff0300000000000000000000000000000000000000280000003000000017000000010001000000000000000000120b0000120b000000004a0056008f002e0006000b0000001708250046004200a90056008b002e0000000a00000026060f000a00ffffffff0100000000000a00000026060f000a0000ffffff0000000000003500000042010500000028000